:''To use this template, type <code>{{t|CommentsHelp}}</code> as a comment.''

<h3>Images</h3>
# Either:
## If the file already exists, find its name
## If the file doesn't already exist, upload the file at [[Special:Upload]] and make note of the file name
# Write <code><nowiki>[[File:filename]]</nowiki></code>

e.g. for [[:File:Uni000 f00.png]] you'd write<pre>[[File:Uni000 f00.png]]</pre> which gets you [[File:Uni000 f00.png]]<br>
If you want to adjust the size, then add the size at the end, e.g. <pre>[[File:AngelicCroaknir.png|300px]]</pre> gives you [[File:AngelicCroaknir.png|300px]]

See more information at [[mw:Help:Images#Rendering a single image]].